WEBVTT

01:30.289 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.370 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 32]

01:40.590 --> 01:41.789
Zhen,

01:42.000 --> 01:43.310
when you were little,

01:43.509 --> 01:46.509
you often sneaked in here to play,
didn't you?

01:47.150 --> 01:48.229
No.

01:48.229 --> 01:50.000
I only sneaked in once.

01:50.070 --> 01:51.229
My mother caught me

01:51.229 --> 01:53.030
and dragged me out immediately.

01:55.200 --> 01:56.000
Come.

01:56.560 --> 01:57.789
Follow me.

02:09.360 --> 02:11.750
Come, come in.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.079
Zhen.

02:23.520 --> 02:25.840
This is the forbidden area of Li Ink.

02:32.680 --> 02:34.470
Take a good look...

02:37.360 --> 02:40.750
at Li Ink's treasures.

02:48.560 --> 02:49.750
The Ink Vault

02:51.630 --> 02:53.000
is the foundation

02:54.710 --> 02:57.120
of Li family's century-old legacy.

02:57.750 --> 03:00.750
Despite facing internal troubles
and external threats,

03:00.750 --> 03:02.190
ups and downs,

03:02.590 --> 03:04.750
we have survived

03:05.120 --> 03:07.310
because of them.

03:12.190 --> 03:13.590
Lushan Pine Ink.

03:14.590 --> 03:15.800
Zhongjiang's Ink.

03:17.800 --> 03:19.030
So many ancient inks.

03:23.910 --> 03:24.840
Zhen.

03:26.240 --> 03:26.910
Come.

03:29.030 --> 03:30.870
Offer this Sihe Ink

03:31.750 --> 03:34.190
to our Founding Master.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.120
It's because of these

04:52.950 --> 04:54.270
that our Li Ink

04:54.870 --> 04:58.040
can be passed down for generations.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.840
This is what people of Li Ink

05:01.720 --> 05:03.160
will defend

05:04.720 --> 05:06.680
with our lives.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.720
Zhen.

05:24.510 --> 05:25.510
Zhen.

05:26.190 --> 05:27.630
The Li family's legacy

05:28.510 --> 05:30.240
and the Li family's foundation

05:31.120 --> 05:32.920
all lies in these few words:

05:34.270 --> 05:36.390
ink-making techniques.

05:38.070 --> 05:39.240
With it,

05:39.480 --> 05:41.040
people of Li Ink

05:41.310 --> 05:43.190
can get through whatever

05:43.480 --> 05:46.240
hardships and difficulties we experience.

05:46.560 --> 05:49.390
What allows Li Ink to survive

05:50.120 --> 05:53.750
is the technique and spirit.

05:54.510 --> 05:56.070
You must remember this.

05:57.480 --> 05:58.720
I will.

06:01.160 --> 06:02.480
Li Zhen,

06:03.920 --> 06:05.120
it is you

06:06.390 --> 06:08.120
who brought the hope of rebirth

06:08.560 --> 06:11.720
to our Li Ink.

06:15.270 --> 06:16.270
Today,

06:17.190 --> 06:18.360
I am

06:19.310 --> 06:20.950
going to hand over

06:21.480 --> 06:24.680
Li family and Li Ink to you

06:25.480 --> 06:27.240
in front of Founding Master.

06:31.310 --> 06:33.270
You must protect it.

06:37.190 --> 06:39.360
You deserve it.

06:45.430 --> 06:46.690
Seventh Grandmother,

06:47.270 --> 06:51.040
I will do my best—

06:52.390 --> 06:54.360
I swear to protect the Li family

06:55.070 --> 06:56.870
and carry on the legacy of Li Ink.

07:08.030 --> 07:08.920
Rujun.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.390
It's windy at the dock.

07:11.390 --> 07:13.950
Drink this ginger soup
to ward off the cold.

07:17.120 --> 07:18.510
Zhen

07:19.270 --> 07:20.600
is very different

07:21.390 --> 07:25.070
this time she's back.

07:26.930 --> 07:29.450
She told me about the selection
in Nanjing.

07:30.270 --> 07:31.630
From what I heard,

07:32.240 --> 07:36.159
it was a test of
understanding people's hearts.

07:39.720 --> 07:41.830
No one in our Li family except Zhen

07:42.159 --> 07:43.510
is so

07:44.120 --> 07:47.510
observant.

07:51.070 --> 07:53.600
Zhen has her plans.

07:54.510 --> 07:57.630
She looks calm on the surface,

07:58.159 --> 08:00.390
but she acts boldly

08:02.600 --> 08:04.160
yet thoughtfully.

08:04.720 --> 08:08.160
That is the demeanor of a master.

08:09.070 --> 08:10.630
Of course.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.950
She follows the path you laid out for her.

08:12.950 --> 08:15.000
Of course she is just like you.

08:16.230 --> 08:17.830
No, no. No.

08:20.240 --> 08:22.830
She tempered herself through hardships.

08:24.480 --> 08:26.160
Everyone thinks

08:27.070 --> 08:29.040
I was shielding her.

08:33.080 --> 08:34.030
But

08:34.690 --> 08:36.049
I was the one

08:36.080 --> 08:38.559
who was the one most ruthless to her.

08:39.549 --> 08:43.030
I knew very well

08:43.510 --> 08:45.240
she would suffer endless grievances

08:45.240 --> 08:47.480
if I make her carry on
the Li family's legacy,

08:47.480 --> 08:50.360
yet I forcibly dragged her back.

08:55.150 --> 08:56.600
Her journey

08:57.550 --> 08:59.960
has been too tough.

09:02.000 --> 09:03.200
I was thinking,

09:04.440 --> 09:06.640
as she runs forward alone in the future,

09:07.240 --> 09:10.750
no one can stop her anymore.

09:11.270 --> 09:14.150
The burden on your shoulders
can finally be lifted.

09:14.910 --> 09:16.000
Just now,

09:16.480 --> 09:17.810
when I handed her the key

09:18.750 --> 09:20.600
in the Ink Vault,

09:23.390 --> 09:26.360
I saw her expression.

09:29.080 --> 09:32.000
She's going to establish her own school.

09:34.080 --> 09:35.870
She really resembles you a bit

09:36.270 --> 09:39.200
from when you were a young girl.

09:44.000 --> 09:46.150
That feels like a lifetime ago.

09:47.200 --> 09:48.480
You still remember.

09:48.790 --> 09:49.960
It's a pity.

09:51.510 --> 09:53.150
Your whole life

09:53.480 --> 09:54.870
and your talent

09:56.240 --> 09:59.360
are wasted in that high wall.

10:00.870 --> 10:01.790
Rujun.

10:02.600 --> 10:04.270
It's no pity.

10:05.080 --> 10:07.870
I've lived two lives in this lifetime.

10:08.600 --> 10:09.750
I'm content.

10:12.270 --> 10:13.870
The banquet is about to start.

10:13.870 --> 10:15.440
Finish this ginger soup quickly,

10:15.440 --> 10:18.270
and go out to celebrate with your Zhen.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.480
Everyone.

10:25.750 --> 10:27.910
I invited you all to gather here today

10:28.150 --> 10:29.440
for 3 celebrations.

10:30.000 --> 10:31.200
First,

10:31.810 --> 10:34.070
Li Ink has won the Noble Consort's favor,

10:34.270 --> 10:36.840
obtaining the ink supply rights
for the Princess's Mansion,

10:36.840 --> 10:38.870
taking Li Ink to the next level.

10:38.870 --> 10:39.670
Great!

10:40.960 --> 10:41.510
Good!

10:42.480 --> 10:43.910
Congratulations.

10:44.200 --> 10:44.910
Thank you.

10:44.960 --> 10:46.020
Congratulations!

10:46.670 --> 10:48.930
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

10:49.870 --> 10:51.670
-Congratulations.
-Thank you.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.240
Zhengyou.

10:54.840 --> 10:55.750
You've witnessed

10:55.750 --> 10:57.410
the whole process in Nanjing.

10:57.510 --> 11:00.150
This is your first major event
since joining the ink workshop.

11:00.150 --> 11:01.320
With this glass of wine,

11:01.320 --> 11:02.550
I toast to you.

11:03.150 --> 11:04.670
Congratulations on
completing your apprenticeship.

11:04.670 --> 11:05.960
Thank you, Zhen.

11:06.120 --> 11:06.750
Come.

11:12.080 --> 11:13.280
Zhengyou has made it.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.550
Second,

11:18.670 --> 11:20.600
Li Ink Workshop opened in Nanjing.

11:21.120 --> 11:22.870
Li Ink has stepped out of Huizhou,

11:22.870 --> 11:24.800
marching towards a broader world.

11:25.440 --> 11:27.900
Zhengshen is still tending Nanjing’s shop.

11:30.870 --> 11:31.750
Master Qi.

11:33.240 --> 11:36.200
Nanjing is also partially thanks to you.

11:37.120 --> 11:39.030
You and Zhengshen have worked hard.

11:39.030 --> 11:40.360
With this glass of wine,

11:42.080 --> 11:43.030
I toast to you.

11:57.240 --> 11:58.510
Third,

11:58.790 --> 12:01.390
the Li family has welcomed back
our ancestors' Sihe Ink.

12:01.390 --> 12:02.750
The Sihe Ink

12:03.000 --> 12:04.320
has Li Ink's soul.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.480
With the ink back, the soul is back.

12:06.630 --> 12:07.200
Good!

12:07.480 --> 12:08.840
-Good, good.
-Good.

12:10.200 --> 12:10.750
Good.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.000
Zhen.

12:14.840 --> 12:17.270
Li Ink has come this far—

12:17.870 --> 12:20.840
with the road ahead wide
and the people united—

12:21.440 --> 12:24.600
all thanks to you.

12:28.720 --> 12:31.320
I am deeply honored by the love
of all the respected elders,

12:31.320 --> 12:33.630
and will never
let Seventh Grandmother's trust down.

12:33.630 --> 12:35.760
I will continue to lead Li Ink forward,

12:36.120 --> 12:37.520
Before heaven and earth,

12:37.720 --> 12:38.850
before everyone...

12:41.320 --> 12:42.360
With this glass of wine,

12:42.360 --> 12:44.550
I toast to you all.

12:46.360 --> 12:47.840
Come, drink!

12:54.600 --> 12:55.720
Thank you all!

12:56.390 --> 12:57.120
Zhen.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.320
Zhen.

12:59.200 --> 13:00.630
Can I have a look

13:00.630 --> 13:02.440
at Sihe Ink?

13:03.630 --> 13:04.790
Third Master Chen,

13:04.840 --> 13:06.870
stop thinking about our family's ink.

13:06.870 --> 13:07.600
Just drink.

13:07.600 --> 13:08.670
This Jinshui...

13:08.670 --> 13:10.960
Third Grandfather, drink first.

13:11.000 --> 13:13.030
Finish your glass before we talk.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.280
-All right
-Drink up.

13:22.030 --> 13:23.200
Seventh Grandmother.

13:23.200 --> 13:23.720
Come.

13:24.000 --> 13:25.600
I'll go toast another glass.

13:25.720 --> 13:26.630
President Hu.

13:27.120 --> 13:28.650
I would like to toast to you.

13:28.720 --> 13:30.870
Huizhou's ink industry has been
all thanks to you these years.

13:30.870 --> 13:31.600
Manager Zhen.

13:31.600 --> 13:34.730
The Literary Association
is also benefiting from this.

13:36.360 --> 13:37.630
Third Grandfather.

13:37.790 --> 13:39.270
I'm here to toast to you.

13:40.510 --> 13:41.390
Third Grandfather.

13:41.390 --> 13:43.440
Thank you for your care
for me all these years.

13:43.440 --> 13:44.440
It's my pleasure.

13:44.440 --> 13:46.750
I thank you two.

13:47.550 --> 13:48.000
Come, come.

13:48.000 --> 13:50.200
Eat and drink well today.

13:54.150 --> 13:56.390
I'm telling you, drink less.

13:56.390 --> 13:57.910
Who drinks like this?

13:58.000 --> 13:58.790
Hold this.

13:58.960 --> 13:59.910
Pour wine for me.

13:59.910 --> 14:00.670
Come.

14:01.120 --> 14:02.600
Grandpa, Uncle Jingdong.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.130
I'm here to toast you.

14:06.200 --> 14:07.360
Drink slowly.

14:07.510 --> 14:08.840
Grandpa, drink slowly.

14:11.360 --> 14:12.120
Mother.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.480
Eldest Aunt.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.550
Third Aunt.

14:14.750 --> 14:15.670
Sister-in-law.

14:15.670 --> 14:16.630
Aunt Chunhua.

14:16.720 --> 14:19.080
Come, I toast to you.

14:21.320 --> 14:21.840
Come.

14:22.390 --> 14:23.320
I'm drinking up!

14:26.960 --> 14:28.240
Slow down, be careful.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.320
Look at our little Zhengrun.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.090
Master Qi.

14:31.120 --> 14:31.720
Master Qi.

14:31.720 --> 14:32.320
Aunt.

14:32.600 --> 14:33.600
I toast to you.

14:35.240 --> 14:37.440
Thank you for taking care of our Zhen.

14:38.920 --> 14:40.480
Come to our house when you have time.

14:40.480 --> 14:41.630
I'll cook a few dishes,

14:41.630 --> 14:42.960
and we can drink at home.

14:50.080 --> 14:51.340
Tell her to drink less.

14:52.240 --> 14:53.970
I've been pouring very little.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.320
So cute. Who put this on you?

14:56.960 --> 14:57.820
Let me kiss you.

14:57.960 --> 14:58.550
Here.

14:59.440 --> 15:00.320
Another kiss.

15:04.120 --> 15:05.240
Did you drink too much?

15:05.240 --> 15:06.840
Go ahead with your business.

15:11.960 --> 15:12.550
Well...

15:12.750 --> 15:13.550
Xianglan.

15:15.150 --> 15:17.280
Zhengshen sent a letter from Nanjing.

15:18.200 --> 15:19.790
It arrived while you

15:20.240 --> 15:21.240
were still on the boat.

15:21.240 --> 15:23.360
He repeatedly urged

15:23.790 --> 15:25.000
that the letter for you

15:25.000 --> 15:26.080
shouldn't be opened

15:26.080 --> 15:27.240
or peeked at.

15:27.550 --> 15:28.210
Here you go.

15:29.310 --> 15:29.910
Thank you.

15:41.320 --> 15:42.870
My dearest Xianglan!

15:43.320 --> 15:44.780
Give the letter back to me!

15:45.300 --> 15:46.940
My dearest Xianglan!

15:47.080 --> 15:48.550
My dearest Xianglan!

15:48.600 --> 15:49.440
Shut up!

15:49.790 --> 15:50.960
All right, all right.

15:50.960 --> 15:52.320
Please have a seat.

15:52.320 --> 15:52.870
Sit.

15:52.870 --> 15:54.120
Hua'er, stop right there!

15:54.120 --> 15:54.960
Father.

15:55.750 --> 15:57.010
Hua'er is bullying me.

15:57.150 --> 15:58.480
You were

15:58.480 --> 16:00.120
grinning from ear to ear.

16:00.200 --> 16:02.150
Take your seat.
I have something important.

16:02.150 --> 16:02.840
Go.

16:05.480 --> 16:06.540
Seventh Old Madam!

16:07.510 --> 16:08.570
Seventh Old Madam!

16:08.600 --> 16:09.790
All of you are here.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.420
Seventh Old Madam.

16:12.670 --> 16:14.240
Congratulations

16:14.320 --> 16:18.050
for securing of the ink supplier right
for the Princess's Mansion.

16:18.300 --> 16:19.820
This brings glory

16:19.850 --> 16:21.450
to our Huizhou ink industry.

16:21.510 --> 16:22.630
Thank you, Lord Yan.

16:22.630 --> 16:24.910
I used Madam Wang's connections

16:24.960 --> 16:27.150
and hired the best theatrical troupe.

16:27.270 --> 16:28.790
They have been waiting at the stage

16:28.790 --> 16:30.000
for a long time.

16:30.080 --> 16:32.720
I especially invite you,
Old Madam, to do us the honor

16:32.720 --> 16:34.750
of watching the play together.

16:37.080 --> 16:39.030
Thank you, Lord Yan

16:39.510 --> 16:42.120
for going such trouble to arrange this.

16:42.150 --> 16:43.390
Since you arrived,

16:43.390 --> 16:45.550
you haven't even sat down
for a proper drink.

16:45.550 --> 16:48.510
I feel bad about it.

16:48.550 --> 16:51.240
How... How about this?

16:51.390 --> 16:54.030
I'll take Zhen
and my female family members

16:54.030 --> 16:55.360
to go watch the play.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.790
This way, you can sit here comfortably

16:57.840 --> 17:00.550
and enjoy drinking with everyone.

17:00.550 --> 17:02.480
How about that?

17:02.670 --> 17:04.310
That's great!

17:08.550 --> 17:10.000
I'm happy today.

17:10.480 --> 17:12.349
My granddaughters

17:12.790 --> 17:15.000
and daughters-in-law,

17:15.240 --> 17:17.790
let's have a drink to warm up first.

17:26.440 --> 17:27.400
Old Madam.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.620
This theatrical troupe today

17:29.830 --> 17:32.350
was invited to celebrate
the joy of Li Ink.

17:32.510 --> 17:34.110
Please choose a play

17:34.110 --> 17:35.880
for everyone's entertainment.

17:35.880 --> 17:38.510
Cuiqiao, thank you.

17:41.030 --> 17:42.350
So many.

17:42.750 --> 17:44.310
"Baihua Presents a Sword."

17:44.720 --> 17:48.550
When I was young,

17:48.830 --> 17:51.030
my friends and I

17:51.030 --> 17:53.920
loved watching this play the most.

17:55.480 --> 17:57.880
After watching this play, my friends and I

17:58.070 --> 18:03.440
would imitate, recite,
and dance it every day.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.240
I still remember.

18:09.830 --> 18:17.550
♪ Flowers and dew ♪

18:17.960 --> 18:28.000
♪ The moon changes ♪

18:28.920 --> 18:29.790
Bravo!

18:29.790 --> 18:31.070
Beautifully sang!

18:33.480 --> 18:35.000
I was

18:35.000 --> 18:37.030
running out of breath.

18:37.030 --> 18:38.160
I couldn't tell at all.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.960
And I was out of tune too.

18:41.480 --> 18:42.590
But...

18:44.200 --> 18:46.240
But those past events...

18:48.270 --> 18:50.070
they are vivid in my mind.

18:54.270 --> 18:57.160
Every time I watch this play,

18:58.270 --> 19:01.750
I'll be happy for days.

19:03.510 --> 19:06.310
So which play do you
want to listen to today?

19:07.790 --> 19:12.110
Today I'll request for
"The Tale of Two Heroes."

19:13.000 --> 19:14.510
Yes, Old Madam.

19:27.070 --> 19:34.270
♪ I, Liang Hongyu ♪

19:38.240 --> 19:42.680
♪ As Wuzhu launched
an army against our borders ♪

19:42.960 --> 19:46.030
♪ The people are in misery ♪

19:46.310 --> 19:49.310
♪ I'll fight with the General ♪

19:49.510 --> 19:54.350
♪ And Jin soldiers in Jinshan today ♪

19:57.880 --> 19:58.720
Zhen.

19:59.480 --> 20:01.830
Liang Hongyu is so heroic and valiant.

20:02.030 --> 20:03.310
I really admire her.

20:03.830 --> 20:05.830
Liang Hongyu defends the country,

20:06.160 --> 20:09.070
while our Seventh Grandmother
is the Head of the House and manager.

20:09.070 --> 20:11.680
Both of them are role models for women.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.350
Now,

20:14.350 --> 20:15.790
my Zhen,

20:15.790 --> 20:18.400
you are the manager.

20:34.720 --> 20:35.270
Good!

20:41.830 --> 20:46.440
♪ I can't help but feel regretful
seeing these cunning invaders roaring ♪

20:46.750 --> 20:49.070
♪ Hold the armor, get on the horse,
and wield your sword ♪

20:49.110 --> 20:52.110
♪ Hold the armor, get on the horse,
and wield your sword ♪

20:52.110 --> 20:55.720
♪ The female celestial demon
comes down from the highest heaven ♪

20:55.790 --> 21:04.790
♪ Just look at how powerful I am
fighting this war ♪

21:04.880 --> 21:05.750
Bravo!

21:08.400 --> 21:09.200
Bravo!

21:09.830 --> 21:10.590
Bravo!

21:18.400 --> 21:21.240
The beating drums and sounding gongs

21:22.030 --> 21:25.030
are so magnificent,

21:25.440 --> 21:27.510
that they make me, Wang Rujun,

21:28.830 --> 21:31.720
extremely excited.

21:33.350 --> 21:35.790
Liang Hongyu,

21:37.200 --> 21:39.240
the war drums beat

21:39.960 --> 21:42.030
as the soldiers march to battle—

21:42.110 --> 21:46.240
such boundless heroism.

21:48.030 --> 21:49.480
I'm tired of sitting.

21:49.680 --> 21:51.550
I want to get down and walk.

21:52.200 --> 21:54.830
Put me down.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.220
Seventh Grandmother.

21:57.220 --> 21:59.200
Grandmother, it's is already winter.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.510
It's getting cold.

22:00.550 --> 22:01.550
If you want to walk,

22:01.550 --> 22:02.610
let's go take a look

22:02.610 --> 22:03.920
at Nanjing's shop

22:03.920 --> 22:05.070
next spring, okay?

22:05.590 --> 22:06.750
Exactly, Mother.

22:06.970 --> 22:08.480
The night road is hard to walk on.

22:08.480 --> 22:10.610
You should get back in the sedan chair.

22:10.920 --> 22:11.960
Go back.

22:13.510 --> 22:14.510
Go back.

22:17.590 --> 22:19.590
I insist on walking.

22:19.920 --> 22:20.680
Okay.

22:20.750 --> 22:22.920
I want to walk today,

22:24.030 --> 22:25.830
right now.

22:29.880 --> 22:31.680
This street,

22:32.000 --> 22:35.960
go straight ahead and it leads
to the Li family's ink workshop.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.640
When I married into the Li family

22:40.720 --> 22:42.850
and just became the daughter-in-law,

22:43.310 --> 22:46.550
I went in and out countless times.

22:47.480 --> 22:51.440
Whether it was windy, raining, or hailing,

22:52.070 --> 22:53.440
I was always running

22:55.440 --> 22:58.110
to deliver food to my Jintai.

22:58.440 --> 23:00.480
And then I would

23:01.110 --> 23:02.160
run back

23:03.000 --> 23:04.550
to pacify

23:04.920 --> 23:07.830
Jingyuan in swaddling clothes.

23:14.110 --> 23:18.030
The past days were good.

23:18.550 --> 23:20.880
There was hope.

23:25.480 --> 23:26.550
Nowadays,

23:27.200 --> 23:28.790
I, the daughter-in-law,

23:29.440 --> 23:31.290
have become a mother-in-law.

23:31.790 --> 23:34.160
I am your mother-in-law,

23:35.160 --> 23:38.440
and I've become your Seventh Grandmother.

23:39.480 --> 23:42.590
With you two accompanying me,

23:42.680 --> 23:44.590
not to mention walking home together,

23:44.590 --> 23:45.880
even if we walk to Xin'an River

23:45.880 --> 23:48.720
and take a swim, it would be fine!

23:48.720 --> 23:49.980
Seventh Grandmother,

23:50.270 --> 23:53.200
why did you drink so much today?

23:56.830 --> 23:57.680
I...

23:58.680 --> 23:59.480
I...

24:00.340 --> 24:02.940
I miss Jintai.

24:10.920 --> 24:12.830
Let's go.

24:14.350 --> 24:16.790
With you two protecting me,

24:17.310 --> 24:20.030
how could I not make it home?

24:25.750 --> 24:30.070
It's been a long time
since I felt as happy

24:30.270 --> 24:32.310
as I do tonight.

24:34.550 --> 24:35.830
Zhen,

24:36.200 --> 24:37.680
thank you.

24:40.110 --> 24:41.830
I want to ask you,

24:42.160 --> 24:43.750
are you happy?

24:44.880 --> 24:46.550
Protecting the Li family

24:47.000 --> 24:48.680
is my fate

24:48.830 --> 24:51.030
but not necessarily yours.

24:52.380 --> 24:54.820
I want you

24:55.880 --> 24:59.240
to go for your own goal.

24:59.960 --> 25:03.110
I hope you can boldy

25:03.790 --> 25:06.750
pursue your own happiness.

25:08.590 --> 25:09.850
Seventh Grandmother,

25:11.160 --> 25:13.550
coming to this family was my own choice.

25:14.070 --> 25:15.270
In this family,

25:15.920 --> 25:17.070
I am very happy.

25:18.070 --> 25:19.200
Good.

25:20.070 --> 25:21.750
Good.

25:25.720 --> 25:26.920
Seventh Grandmother,

25:26.920 --> 25:28.180
do you still remember?

25:28.270 --> 25:29.440
When I was little,

25:29.550 --> 25:31.830
when my parents went into the mountains,

25:32.110 --> 25:33.960
I would run over to sleep with you.

25:33.960 --> 25:35.070
Back then,

25:35.070 --> 25:37.270
you'd always sang a nursery rhyme to me.

25:37.310 --> 25:39.640
Of course I remember.

25:40.830 --> 25:43.550
♪ Corn pastry ♪

25:46.400 --> 25:47.660
Seventh Grandmother,

25:47.790 --> 25:50.240
let me sing it for you.

25:50.510 --> 25:52.110
Sleep well tonight,

25:52.200 --> 25:55.200
and I'll buy you
a corn pastry tomorrow morning, okay?

25:56.310 --> 25:58.590
Okay, okay.

26:00.640 --> 26:04.350
♪ Step on the fire ♪

26:02.090 --> 26:11.970
[The melody is inspired by a folk song
in Huizhou, "Rice and Wheat Grinding."]

26:04.480 --> 26:08.200
♪ We hold corn pastry in our hands ♪

26:08.420 --> 26:12.200
♪ Eat the pork in a bowl ♪

26:12.310 --> 26:20.200
♪ I'm living a life of bliss, like a god ♪

26:23.510 --> 26:26.200
♪ Step on the fire ♪

26:26.550 --> 26:29.270
♪ We hold corn pastry in our hands ♪

26:29.510 --> 26:32.240
♪ Eat the pork in a bowl ♪

26:32.510 --> 26:34.000
♪ I'm living a life of bliss, like a god ♪

26:37.110 --> 26:39.880
♪ Step on the fire ♪

26:39.920 --> 26:42.590
♪ We hold corn pastry in our hands ♪

26:43.000 --> 26:44.260
Seventh Grandmother,

26:44.550 --> 26:45.960
I bought the corn pastry.

26:46.030 --> 26:46.880
Wake up.

26:47.510 --> 26:49.170
Smell it, isn't it fragrant?

26:50.160 --> 26:51.960
Seventh Grandmother, wake up.

26:53.350 --> 26:55.310
Seventh Grandmother, wake up.

26:55.640 --> 26:56.900
Seventh Grandmother!

27:01.400 --> 27:02.660
Seventh Grandmother!

27:37.300 --> 27:39.790
[He Garden]

27:39.940 --> 27:41.890
[The spirit tablet of
the paternal grandmother, Wang Rujun]

27:51.590 --> 27:54.640
Guests may pay condolences.

28:23.790 --> 28:24.850
Seventh Old Madam,

28:26.790 --> 28:28.110
may you rest in peace.

28:50.590 --> 28:51.640
Rujin,

28:52.960 --> 28:54.620
in the end, I'm the only one...

28:56.270 --> 28:57.350
left...

28:58.910 --> 29:00.620
in this generation.

29:04.240 --> 29:06.000
Letting me live to the end

29:07.070 --> 29:08.240
is also to repay

29:09.000 --> 29:10.030
Sixth Brother,

29:10.680 --> 29:11.680
Seventh Brother,

29:12.350 --> 29:14.000
and Seventh Sister-in-law's

29:14.000 --> 29:16.000
kindness to Jinshui.

29:16.750 --> 29:18.150
You have protected Li Ink

29:18.550 --> 29:20.000
all your life.

29:21.960 --> 29:23.110
You have lived up to

29:23.690 --> 29:25.910
to the saying "upright and honorable."

29:30.310 --> 29:31.710
Seventh Sister-in-law,

29:32.470 --> 29:33.720
rest in peace.

29:35.500 --> 29:37.410
Reunite with Seventh Brother.

29:39.550 --> 29:42.330
[Li's Ancestral Hall]

29:42.830 --> 29:45.350
Wang Rujun,
the matriarch of the Li family,

29:45.680 --> 29:48.160
was respectful and cautious all her life.

29:48.400 --> 29:51.160
She devoted
all her efforts to the Li family

29:51.310 --> 29:53.240
and achieved outstanding merits.

29:53.310 --> 29:55.920
Today, the Li family

29:56.200 --> 29:57.920
wishes to hang her portrait

29:57.960 --> 30:00.350
in the ancestral hall.

30:00.510 --> 30:02.510
We specially open the ancestral hall

30:02.510 --> 30:04.590
to pay respects to the ancestors.

30:10.830 --> 30:11.720
Kneel!

30:17.440 --> 30:18.350
Bow!

30:20.640 --> 30:21.680
Rise!

30:23.400 --> 30:24.400
Up!

30:27.640 --> 30:28.200
Kneel!

30:31.880 --> 30:32.640
Bow!

30:34.590 --> 30:35.640
Rise!

30:59.440 --> 31:01.110
Hang the portrait!

31:17.880 --> 31:19.830
Invite the spirit to take its seat.

31:33.600 --> 31:36.750
[The spirit tablet of Wang Rujun]

32:13.240 --> 32:14.500
You must be exhausted,

32:15.480 --> 32:16.740
holding on for so long.

32:18.200 --> 32:18.920
I'm fine.

32:20.550 --> 32:23.010
I took over Li Ink
from Seventh Grandmother.

32:23.510 --> 32:24.790
Now I must shoulder the responsibility

32:24.790 --> 32:26.480
of the Li family and Li Ink.

32:27.350 --> 32:28.590
If I let myself be

32:29.110 --> 32:31.550
too immersed in painful and depression,

32:32.350 --> 32:33.550
Seventh Grandmother

32:34.190 --> 32:35.850
won't be able to rest in peace.

32:47.750 --> 32:48.680
I know

32:49.550 --> 32:51.110
you've always been strong.

32:54.070 --> 32:55.830
But now that everyone is gone,

32:56.590 --> 32:57.680
if you are sad,

32:59.400 --> 33:00.860
you should just cry it out.

33:07.720 --> 33:08.680
Qi Jiu.

33:11.510 --> 33:13.350
My Seventh Grandmother is gone.

33:16.310 --> 33:18.310
I don't have a grandmother anymore.

33:20.000 --> 33:22.000
I don't have a grandmother anymore.

33:30.110 --> 33:32.640
I don't have Seventh Grandmother anymore.

33:34.550 --> 33:36.410
You'll feel better after crying.

33:58.070 --> 34:00.640
So Manager Zhen and Master Qi...

34:01.750 --> 34:03.410
are already so deeply in love.

34:23.590 --> 34:24.320
Granny,

34:24.880 --> 34:26.400
let me help you pick them up.

34:26.400 --> 34:28.000
Your legs aren't very agile.

34:28.440 --> 34:29.710
Don't pick those up.

34:30.230 --> 34:32.150
Just consider it as a tip
from the Seventh Old Madam

34:32.150 --> 34:34.320
to the wandering ghosts on the road.

34:39.630 --> 34:41.030
Thank you for your help.

34:43.270 --> 34:45.060
With the way I look,

34:45.190 --> 34:46.550
I must have scared you.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.320
I'll leave right away.

34:48.550 --> 34:49.590
I recognize you.

34:52.510 --> 34:53.760
You recognize me?

34:53.920 --> 34:54.480
Yes.

34:54.590 --> 34:55.520
I recognize you.

34:55.670 --> 34:57.400
You are Doggie's grandmother.

34:57.470 --> 34:59.800
When I was staying at
the Li Ink Workshop,

35:00.030 --> 35:01.030
I heard Doggie say

35:01.190 --> 35:02.440
that his granny's cooking

35:02.440 --> 35:04.230
is the best in the world.

35:05.280 --> 35:06.960
It made me so envious.

35:08.800 --> 35:09.920
Doggie

35:10.480 --> 35:11.510
mentioned

35:11.550 --> 35:13.550
that there was a Master Qi in Li Ink

35:13.670 --> 35:15.670
who used to live in the ink workshop.

35:15.700 --> 35:16.300
Is that...

35:16.880 --> 35:18.590
That's me, Qi Jiu.

35:19.400 --> 35:20.670
Qi Jiu?

35:24.190 --> 35:25.440
Are you

35:26.070 --> 35:27.800
the ninth child in your family?

35:28.880 --> 35:29.630
No, no.

35:30.590 --> 35:31.800
I...

35:32.230 --> 35:33.280
am an orphan.

35:34.030 --> 35:36.160
My close relatives passed away early.

35:36.190 --> 35:38.550
This name was given to me by my brothers

35:38.550 --> 35:39.280
out there.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.110
I see.

35:41.710 --> 35:42.920
Forgive my presumption.

35:42.920 --> 35:43.720
No, it's fine.

35:43.920 --> 35:44.590
Granny,

35:45.190 --> 35:47.070
it's cold and windy outside.

35:47.070 --> 35:48.730
You should go back in and rest.

35:48.760 --> 35:50.670
I will take my leave first.

36:11.580 --> 36:16.090
[Nanjing]

36:12.110 --> 36:12.710
Mr. Wu.

36:17.550 --> 36:18.670
Why is it 30% more

36:18.670 --> 36:19.930
than what I mentioned?

36:21.760 --> 36:23.090
The path you pointed out

36:23.110 --> 36:24.400
is truly a clear one.

36:24.800 --> 36:27.130
We've already run it successfully twice.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.190
This

36:28.510 --> 36:30.040
is to show my respect to you.

36:30.110 --> 36:33.110
Please continue to look after me
in the future, Mr. Wu.

36:35.280 --> 36:37.480
This is all thanks to
your own intelligence, Mr. Tian.

36:37.480 --> 36:39.960
You figured out
this path's method yourself.

36:39.960 --> 36:40.760
It has nothing to do

36:40.760 --> 36:42.030
with me at all.

36:42.070 --> 36:43.500
How could it have nothing to do with you?

36:43.500 --> 36:46.700
It's all thanks to your efforts
in smoothing things over—

36:52.960 --> 36:54.890
It has nothing to do with you at all.

36:55.360 --> 36:57.030
It was all my own idea,

36:57.230 --> 36:58.760
a path I came up with myself.

36:59.150 --> 37:00.480
But don't worry, Mr. Wu.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.000
There is

37:02.070 --> 37:03.870
nothing wrong with this silver.

37:04.150 --> 37:06.080
The collected Japanese silver...

37:10.960 --> 37:12.630
has already been dealt with.

37:12.760 --> 37:14.630
It's been laundered completely clean.

37:14.630 --> 37:15.480
Rest assured.

37:17.360 --> 37:18.150
Good.

37:18.760 --> 37:20.690
You are very thoughtful, Mr. Tian.

37:22.440 --> 37:23.360
Mr. Tian,

37:23.480 --> 37:25.080
you are a man of great talent.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.630
With such courage and strategy,

37:26.630 --> 37:27.630
in the future,

37:29.190 --> 37:31.230
your prospects are undoubtedly boundless.

37:31.230 --> 37:32.360
You flatter me, Mr. Wu.

37:32.360 --> 37:32.880
Please.

37:38.550 --> 37:39.400
Mr. Tian.

37:40.030 --> 37:41.110
There is one thing

37:41.280 --> 37:42.920
I need to remind you.

37:43.550 --> 37:44.550
Please, go ahead.

37:45.880 --> 37:47.710
You and I both walk in the light.

37:47.880 --> 37:49.110
Our hands

37:49.230 --> 37:50.960
must remain absolutely clean.

37:51.190 --> 37:53.250
They cannot be tainted with any dirt.

37:53.480 --> 37:55.070
Those loose threads in the dark

37:55.070 --> 37:56.840
should be pinned on others.

37:57.590 --> 37:59.480
If someone goes against you

37:59.710 --> 38:01.670
and tries to defame you,

38:06.190 --> 38:07.030
then...

38:12.510 --> 38:13.310
I understand.

38:14.550 --> 38:15.440
I understand.

38:16.030 --> 38:17.960
Thank you for the reminder, Mr. Wu.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.060
Speaking of which,

38:23.440 --> 38:24.440
there is one more thing.

38:24.440 --> 38:27.510
I would like to ask you
for a small favor, Young Master Wu.

38:27.510 --> 38:28.440
Last time,

38:28.840 --> 38:30.970
we let that Qi Jiu escape by sheer luck.

38:31.000 --> 38:32.200
Count himself lucky.

38:33.670 --> 38:34.880
But strangely,

38:35.760 --> 38:37.820
afterward, he had no reaction at all.

38:38.000 --> 38:40.110
He didn't report
to the authorities or investigate.

38:40.110 --> 38:42.590
The more I think about it,
the more suspicious he seems.

38:42.590 --> 38:44.190
So I wanted to ask you, Mr. Wu,

38:44.280 --> 38:45.210
to help out again

38:45.320 --> 38:47.190
and thoroughly check his background

38:47.190 --> 38:48.720
to prevent future trouble.

38:49.590 --> 38:51.840
My father has some connections
in the Ministry of Revenue.

38:51.840 --> 38:53.150
Investigating someone

38:53.150 --> 38:54.280
is a small matter.

38:56.590 --> 38:57.280
Mr. Wu.

38:58.000 --> 38:58.920
I, Tian Benchang,

38:58.920 --> 39:01.190
today acknowledge you
as my own older brother.

39:01.190 --> 39:03.000
In the future, for every part I get,

39:03.000 --> 39:04.550
you will get two parts.

39:08.440 --> 39:09.510
Brother Tian,

39:10.630 --> 39:12.150
how can the small
Directorate of Imperial Household

39:12.150 --> 39:13.440
possibly keep you?

39:14.480 --> 39:17.000
In the future,
when you achieve your grand plans,

39:17.000 --> 39:18.530
don't forget me, my friend.

39:19.030 --> 39:20.030
You are joking.

39:20.230 --> 39:21.150
You flatter me, Mr. Wu.

39:21.150 --> 39:21.630
Come.

39:37.840 --> 39:38.510
Brother.

39:39.550 --> 39:40.960
We can't do this.

39:41.110 --> 39:42.230
If someone finds out,

39:42.230 --> 39:43.590
we'll be beheaded.

39:46.550 --> 39:48.550
You're the one who came to Nanjing

39:49.360 --> 39:52.110
And you were the one begging
to do business with me.

39:52.110 --> 39:53.170
Now you're scared?

39:53.840 --> 39:56.230
I didn't know we would be trading
with foreigners before I came.

39:56.230 --> 39:57.000
So what?

39:58.000 --> 39:59.070
Now that you know,

39:59.550 --> 40:00.680
you're backing out?

40:06.360 --> 40:07.160
Open the door.

40:20.000 --> 40:21.800
Mr. Tian, everything is inside.

40:31.030 --> 40:32.150
Leave the stuff here.

40:32.150 --> 40:33.030
Wait outside.

40:47.280 --> 40:47.920
Come here.

40:54.110 --> 40:55.110
Stamp this for me.

40:58.760 --> 41:00.380
Brother, I didn't bring my name seal.

41:00.380 --> 41:01.800
Didn't I tell you to bring it?

41:01.800 --> 41:02.400
Yes,

41:03.070 --> 41:04.320
but I forgot.

41:09.960 --> 41:10.490
Brother!

41:11.440 --> 41:11.970
Brother!

41:12.670 --> 41:13.200
Brother!

41:22.800 --> 41:23.440
Stamp it.

41:26.670 --> 41:27.440
Stamp it!

41:32.150 --> 41:33.630
Brother, I dare not.

41:34.480 --> 41:35.000
Brother!

41:35.000 --> 41:36.130
Brother, I dare not!

41:50.960 --> 41:52.760
Get people to transport the ink!

42:10.630 --> 42:12.000
I was originally worried

42:12.000 --> 42:13.320
that there'd be no one to tend the shop

42:13.320 --> 42:15.920
in Nanjing
with me coming back for the funeral.

42:15.920 --> 42:17.630
But it's all thanks to to Clerk Qi's help.

42:17.630 --> 42:19.480
He immediately sent a manager over.

42:19.480 --> 42:21.510
He seems very reliable,

42:21.630 --> 42:23.830
so I could rush back with a peace of mind.

42:24.230 --> 42:25.400
When I returned,

42:25.440 --> 42:26.880
several types of ink in the shop

42:26.880 --> 42:28.280
were almost out of stock.

42:28.400 --> 42:29.800
It's been a long time since then.

42:29.800 --> 42:31.840
We need to restock quickly.

42:33.200 --> 42:35.710
Since expensive inks
are selling well in Nanjing,

42:35.710 --> 42:38.880
let's bring
more ancient lacquer-soot ink this time.

42:40.840 --> 42:41.880
The spring examination is approaching.

42:41.880 --> 42:44.000
Origin and Shizi Ink will sell fast,

42:44.110 --> 42:45.320
so prepare some of those too.

42:45.320 --> 42:45.920
Okay.

42:47.590 --> 42:48.650
Seems like the inks

42:48.670 --> 42:50.150
will be ready today.

42:52.070 --> 42:53.870
I'll go say goodbye to Xianglan,

42:53.880 --> 42:55.110
and leave tomorrow.

42:56.440 --> 42:57.320
Manager Zhen.

42:57.800 --> 42:58.400
Master.

42:59.360 --> 43:00.590
The mines in the southeast are rioting.

43:00.590 --> 43:02.250
The refugees fled to Huizhou.

43:03.360 --> 43:04.070
What?
